  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "CalendarLabel",
      "text": "CREATIVE PRACTICE / EXAMPLE PLAN"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "NOVEMBER 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A small invitation, three days a week. Start with 10 minutes if that works for you."
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarNote",
      "text": "A / Notice one detail B / Combine two things C / Change one choice"
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarLabel",
      "text": "ONE THING I WANT TO CARRY FORWARD"
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarNote",
      "text": "13 suggested sessions on Monday, Wednesday and Saturday. Prompt menu and reflection space: page 2."
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarLabel",
      "text": "CREATIVE PRACTICE / EXAMPLE PLAN"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "MAKE ROOM TO TRY."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use the calendar as a plan. A prompt is an invitation; move, shorten or skip it when needed."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A / Notice one detail"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose an ordinary object. Record one small detail through a drawing, a few words, a spoken note or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "B / Combine two things"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Bring together two shapes, sounds or ideas from your day. Make one small new arrangement; it does not…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "C / Change one choice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Return to a small piece you made. Change one element, such as scale, order, rhythm or a word. Notice…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "LOOK BACK, WITHOUT A SCORE."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Leave these spaces empty until you have something to record. An unfinished attempt can still give you…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarLabel",
      "text": "What caught my attention?"
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarLabel",
      "text": "What would I change or try next?"
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarNote",
      "text": "Make it workable: use materials and a mode you already have. The 10-minute suggestion is optional;…"
    },
    {
      "style": "CalendarNote",
      "text": "Example intentions only. No completed practice, participation or learning benefit is recorded."
    }
  ],
